    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW BEFORE THE STORM HITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mars survival management simulator in which you must produce fuel from bacteria and algae to leave Mars before an incoming storm destroys your base. Defend your base from the bacteria that infest it. Manage the fuel that also powers your base's elevator. Make crucial decisions to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR BASE FROM THE BACTERIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE CRUCIAL DECISIONS TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/6e592a0800d964570974b2b5420b3d3e.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=692 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/6e592a0800d964570974b2b5420b3d3e.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/6e592a0800d964570974b2b5420b3d3e.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/582e1fada2e1cf431e0a2b53414fd7b4.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=732 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/582e1fada2e1cf431e0a2b53414fd7b4.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/582e1fada2e1cf431e0a2b53414fd7b4.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>MANAGE THE FUEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the fuel that also powers your base's elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage oxygen and energy, make water from ice, resist cold and radiation, grow crops, mine minerals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments to upgrade with faster and most advanced technologies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Research and combine new elements to improve fuel production </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade your equipment </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW BEFORE THE STORM HITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/16dd4154dd763ba6a22553cb5331c505.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mars survival management simulator in which you must produce fuel from bacteria and algae to leave Mars before an incoming storm destroys your base. Defend your base from the bacteria that infest it. Manage the fuel that also powers your base's elevator. Make crucial decisions to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR BASE FROM THE BACTERIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.poster.avif?t=1748277712\" width=614 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.webm?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/14159303936f69f1617020a57fe93f78.mp4?t=1748277712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE CRUCIAL DECISIONS TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.